  "description": "A fast and flexible data logging/tracing toolkit for software testing, debugging, and visualization. Features minimally intrusive C/C++ code instrumentation, a host-based decoding application, and demo code. It is essentially an fprintf() function that runs on the host instead of the embedded system.",
